abstract: >-
  Quorum performs exact fixed-family mining of subgroups whose positive
  outcome association is supported in a prespecified number of sources.
  This release contains reference implementations, synthetic generators,
  harmonized public-data matrices, statistical simulations, runtime and
  memory measurements, and deterministic result verification.
